Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.02,0:00:15.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.88,0:00:16.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.73,0:00:18.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will you take these vegetables to Old Lü?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.89,0:00:19.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:21.88,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780,118)}Dongdong\NBobo\NMang Yan\NKali\NGen\NMutou\NYunfei\NDa Shuang
