Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.72,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1078,758)}Piyu:\NTao Bao\N\NHeishu:\NAi Suo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:33.72,Staff2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(522,770)}Sun Yujing\NSun Zhongyang\NWang Miao\NBohe
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.45,0:00:46.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.23,0:00:47.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Xiaobai, your teacher.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.54,0:00:48.17,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the interpretator.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On today's lesson,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.93,0:00:54.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we'll learn what not to eat.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.75,0:00:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you draw up there?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:03.84,Episode title 17,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1400,486)}Peace and Quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.42,0:01:02.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, don't disturb my lesson!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.60,0:01:03.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm outta here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.86,0:01:07.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me explain with real objects.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.25,0:01:08.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which he's eating.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.03,0:01:21.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! You must listen to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.03,0:01:24.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't eat that.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.38,0:01:25.89,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.42,0:01:29.12,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Because if you don't listen to me, you can't be here with us.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.91,0:01:31.02,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.60,0:01:32.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't feel bad about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you get hungry,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.01,0:01:35.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll give you lots of wood to eat.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.29,0:01:38.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So be a good boy!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.62,0:01:39.66,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.38,0:01:43.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's easier to teach him using food.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't translate this.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.21,0:01:57.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is convenient!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.83,0:02:00.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's a shame it caused so much damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.80,0:02:04.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A shark?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.26,0:02:06.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why is there a shark here?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.13,0:02:07.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.10,0:02:12.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no shark.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.50,0:02:17.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's quite big...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.32,0:02:19.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A water spirit?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.28,0:02:21.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was it drawn here by the flood?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.98,0:02:24.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or driven out from the village by it...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.99,0:02:26.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope it can understand me...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.44,0:02:35.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shoot...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.71,0:02:36.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I've gone and done it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.51,0:02:41.56,Text G,,0,0,0,,{\pos(326,486)}Ancestral shrine of the Wei family
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.85,0:02:39.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.08,0:02:47.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.33,0:03:12.22,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat this?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.56,0:03:14.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can eat this.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're back!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.95,0:03:23.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you healed enough for today?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.44,0:03:23.98,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.98,0:03:24.76,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.07,0:03:25.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can eat it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.44,0:03:29.45,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.32,0:03:32.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about that? I'm a good teacher.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.65,0:03:33.25,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.48,0:03:35.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Heishu!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.49,0:03:37.10,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat this?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.78,0:03:42.66,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He keeps asking you?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.89,0:03:44.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel we'll have a problem...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.73,0:03:46.69,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I eat this?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.74,0:03:48.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This you can eat,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.21,0:03:51.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you can't go on like this...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.59,0:03:53.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.11,0:04:15.77,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.57,0:04:17.82,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you eat too much, you get stuck at one place.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.82,0:04:18.46,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.84,0:04:19.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't know that...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.37,0:04:22.31,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You believed this...?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.96,0:04:24.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gone.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.80,0:04:28.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems he's just on the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.90,0:04:31.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.40,0:04:34.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was this your ability now?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.56,0:04:37.19,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.68,0:04:38.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.70,0:04:39.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can get food without getting out of bed!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.64,0:04:46.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu's scared stiff...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I found him.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.24,0:05:21.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.36,0:05:23.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,100 miles southwest.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.88,0:05:24.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's him?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.14,0:05:26.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He fits your description.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.22,0:05:28.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ice type by appearance.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll look into it first.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why look for him?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.80,0:05:37.61,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Laozi announced that the Sky Pearl\Nwas taken the day after we went there.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.74,0:05:38.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.70,0:05:40.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Diting and Xuanli were there,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.82,0:05:43.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who could have taken the Pearl from them?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.40,0:05:44.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi could.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.70,0:05:53.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine. Who else could?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.11,0:05:55.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting is Laozi's man.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.70,0:05:56.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Xuanli isn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.18,0:05:59.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you think Xuanli took the Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.23,0:06:01.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm 60 percent sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.68,0:06:02.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we must look into it.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.61,0:06:05.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if it's really Xuanli,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.74,0:06:07.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we can't stand up against him.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.02,0:06:10.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Head-on attacks are not my style.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.15,0:06:16.67,Main Dialogue Right,,0,50,0,,'Cause you're weak at close combat?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.00,0:06:16.67,Main Dialogue Left,,150,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.24,0:06:45.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The flood has finally gone!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:45.34,0:06:46.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
