Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.81,0:07:07.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll need to tear down the whole roof...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.28,0:07:09.33,Episode title 18,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,0)\pos(480,592)}Power Struggle
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.38,0:07:08.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be big work...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure I can't ask Laozi for compensation?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.43,0:07:13.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.41,0:07:14.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.86,0:07:15.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can fix it easily.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.05,0:07:18.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My saved money...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.42,0:07:18.75,Text G4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1310,210)}Chirr
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.04,0:07:19.42,Text G4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1310,210)}Chirp
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.75,0:07:20.04,Text G4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1310,210)}Chill
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.34,0:07:22.59,Text G4,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\pos(1310,210)}Chili...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.89,0:07:47.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.03,0:07:49.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The house gets much more light now.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.14,0:07:52.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So should I build an open-air kitchen?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.30,0:07:52.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.99,0:07:55.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'd die of heat when the air con doesn't run.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.79,0:07:54.45,Text D6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1290,266)}Air con
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.79,0:07:54.45,Text D6,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\pos(1330,290)}↙
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.40,0:07:59.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems it will be very hot today.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.53,0:08:01.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.71,0:08:02.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do the sweeping.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.83,0:08:04.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bring two watermelons from Big Ji's.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.81,0:08:05.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.13,0:08:07.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All set.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.21,0:08:08.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.79,0:08:09.46,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, Auntie Cow!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.31,0:08:14.60,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.09,0:08:16.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning, meow!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good afternoon, meow!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.10,0:08:19.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good evening, meow, meow, meow!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.01,0:08:24.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enemy detected.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.62,0:08:30.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.90,0:08:31.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.18,0:08:32.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.10,0:08:34.82,Main Dialogue Right,,0,50,0,,Gen wants to challenge me?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.41,0:08:34.82,Main Dialogue Left,,50,0,0,,I'm here for watermelons.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.08,0:08:36.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.99,0:08:37.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:46.24,0:08:47.00,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,New guys arrived.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.84,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At last, someone to bully.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.56,0:08:57.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll sweep later...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.44,0:08:59.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, keep an eye on Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.12,0:09:00.80,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.26,0:09:02.88,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're here.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.00,0:09:04.70,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.69,0:09:11.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are these two fine?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.09,0:09:13.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you choose is perfect.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.87,0:09:16.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Only you guys are home?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.27,0:09:18.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dad and Mom are out at the watermelon fields.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:20.15,0:09:21.11,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's with these guys?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.46,0:09:26.13,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- Why didn't you say he's that strong?!\N- Would you have believed it?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.13,0:09:27.75,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- I still can't!\N- Yeah, sure!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.75,0:09:28.35,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:28.94,0:09:29.83,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- It caught up!\N- This one's not so bad!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.83,0:09:30.37,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.37,0:09:31.75,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- Run!\N- We're already running!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.45,0:09:40.20,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gathering?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.03,0:09:55.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:55.82,0:09:57.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Big Ji!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.12,0:09:59.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.59,0:10:03.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heishu, where's everyone else?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.51,0:10:16.74,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well. A cat beat you?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.07,0:10:18.03,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're useless.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.45,0:10:20.02,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Told you not to mess with us, cats!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.33,0:10:21.72,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- He's stronger than you! \N- You talk like a loser!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.72,0:10:23.14,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- Then fight him!\N- You don't scare me!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.14,0:10:24.52,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- And who gave you that scar on your face?\N- What about yours?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.52,0:10:25.99,Animal Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,- I got it when I tripped up!\N- We tripped up together!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.12,0:10:34.65,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it him?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.65,0:10:35.37,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He looks weak.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.55,0:10:36.07,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll regret that.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.61,0:10:37.91,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Listen, newcomer. I am...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.38,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so insolent!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.98,0:10:45.87,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother Gray was careless.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.87,0:10:46.52,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I will...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:52.48,0:10:52.99,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.70,0:10:55.53,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're home.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.32,0:10:57.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Xiaohei found Piyu?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.80,0:10:58.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry back!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.35,0:11:13.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.54,0:11:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
