Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.06,0:12:04.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The flood has damaged the ancestral shrine?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.47,0:12:05.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.17,0:12:06.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The mayor's asking for donations.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:07.21,0:12:07.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.50,0:12:09.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be there shortly.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.78,0:12:17.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The ancestral shrine?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:17.92,0:12:18.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.04,0:12:21.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's home is in a mess now.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.70,0:12:23.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid no one can donate.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.15,0:12:27.51,Internal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot about it...
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.44,0:12:31.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing up there?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.39,0:12:33.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looking if we have some money left.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:33.80,0:12:34.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:34.75,0:12:35.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.80,0:12:38.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.96,0:12:40.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just tell the mayor about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:40.76,0:12:42.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll renovate the shrine.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.76,0:12:43.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do you get money?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.07,0:12:46.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As far as I know, we've got a check.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:47.14,0:12:47.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:50.17,0:12:51.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we can claim it?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.87,0:12:52.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.33,0:12:55.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This would be a great help for the village.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.65,0:12:57.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's nothing...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.09,0:13:02.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're leaving now!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.54,0:13:03.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You go too...?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.05,0:13:05.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a bus to town anyway.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.82,0:13:07.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I can visit Shan Xin.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.96,0:13:09.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it dangerous?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's weird you have clothes on.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.80,0:13:14.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You say it like I usually had none on.
