Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.45,0:13:58.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this really the place?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.85,0:14:02.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It should be, according to the address...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.81,0:14:05.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Children!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you looking for?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:08.96,0:14:11.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good morning! We'd like to meet the manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.06,0:14:13.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you have an appointment?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.18,0:14:13.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:13.80,0:14:14.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Access card?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.78,0:14:15.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.52,0:14:17.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got it!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.25,0:14:18.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.13,0:14:20.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's from Laozi.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.27,0:14:25.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are your parents?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.46,0:14:27.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No good?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.07,0:14:28.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Children.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.17,0:14:31.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A paper with a scribble on is not an access card.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.44,0:14:36.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe he pulled our legs...?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.30,0:14:41.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think there's a possibility...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.54,0:14:43.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what do we do now?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:44.04,0:14:44.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just go home?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.08,0:14:47.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll have to sneak in.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.29,0:14:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.68,0:14:50.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just get further from the gate.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.10,0:14:51.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Piyu!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:51.93,0:14:52.66,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:57.97,0:14:59.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can get in from here.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.78,0:15:01.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But this wall's quite tall...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.92,0:15:02.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How do we get in?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.50,0:15:04.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei can help.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.70,0:15:05.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.67,0:15:09.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's inside!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.74,0:15:11.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's looking for a landing place.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.16,0:15:14.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go in first.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.22,0:15:15.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, and don't move.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.27,0:15:15.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.99,0:15:19.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're inside!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you're awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.33,0:15:25.02,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.71,0:15:31.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's like the forest again.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:31.42,0:15:32.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.93,0:15:35.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'd be here if we entered at the gate.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:36.07,0:15:37.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we should be around here.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:37.96,0:15:39.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our destination is here.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.07,0:15:41.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't know the scale of the map.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.61,0:15:43.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we'll need to pass a hill.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.56,0:15:45.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's far away...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:45.66,0:15:48.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute! Xiaohei could teleport us there!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.17,0:15:50.33,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now I can do it only within 5 yards...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.02,0:15:51.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.96,0:15:58.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is strange...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.58,0:16:01.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Trees are bigger here than in the mountains.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They easily are several hundred years old.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.14,0:16:05.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They take care of them well, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.26,0:16:07.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It can't be of a natural reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:18.00,0:16:19.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai, look at this!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.23,0:16:19.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Coming!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.93,0:16:24.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're that high already?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.58,0:16:26.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can see our house.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.95,0:16:32.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the visitor's office, according to the map.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.72,0:16:38.61,Main Dialogue Two-Line,,0,0,0,,Those buildings in the distance must be our destination.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.33,0:16:40.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There should be spirits there.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:41.15,0:16:42.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go there.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.34,0:16:43.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone must find us on the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.96,0:16:46.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And what do we do then?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is why we came, to find someone.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.64,0:16:49.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.95,0:16:50.47,Animal Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've found someone.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:52.02,0:16:53.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you first-time visitors?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.22,0:16:54.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.89,0:16:55.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who introduced you to us?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.25,0:16:56.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laozi.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.10,0:16:57.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:00.06,0:17:00.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Naturally.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.07,0:17:03.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means you are Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.54,0:17:04.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please call me Gen.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.00,0:17:06.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse us for breaking in.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:07.08,0:17:08.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.40,0:17:09.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone enters like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.47,0:17:12.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Tu Bei, the secretary.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.67,0:17:14.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our hall manager has been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.19,0:17:16.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please follow me.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.42,0:17:18.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hall manager?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.92,0:17:20.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's the same as Laozi's place.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.50,0:17:37.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by this, sir?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.23,0:17:41.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A tiger??
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.67,0:17:42.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.75,0:17:43.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.21,0:17:45.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything dangerous.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.31,0:17:47.15,Main Dialogue Left,,50,0,0,,He can talk!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.84,0:17:48.47,Main Dialogue,,300,0,0,,I can't believe you let a human in.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.65,0:17:49.48,Main Dialogue Left,,50,0,0,,He really can talk!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why the bloody hell?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.94,0:17:51.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A Siberian tiger.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.74,0:17:53.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think I'm a country bumpkin if I talk like that?!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.43,0:17:56.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There is no rule saying humans can't enter.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.47,0:18:00.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu, please don't make me intervene.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.61,0:18:03.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loathe humans.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.15,0:18:05.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.13,0:18:08.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This won't make me like humans!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you wear human clothes.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.14,0:18:10.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not with pleasure!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.98,0:18:11.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then take them off.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.81,0:18:12.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.76,0:18:13.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I swear I devour her!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I must apologize for Mr. Fu's behavior.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:18.37,0:18:19.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.59,0:18:22.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Fu is a spirit, one of our clients.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this place, actually?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:25.07,0:18:26.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't Laozi tell about it?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.60,0:18:27.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.96,0:18:29.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then the hall manager will.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.87,0:18:31.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, it's his job.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:33.66,0:18:34.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.44,0:18:37.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You say they have the Sky Pearl?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.47,0:18:38.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.43,0:18:39.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.53,0:18:43.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When was the last time I was wrong?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.61,0:18:47.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.61,0:18:48.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli has arrived.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.14,0:18:50.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This hole is pretty deep.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.25,0:18:52.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is he doing down there?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.18,0:18:57.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kali, the hall manager.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.71,0:18:59.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome to our Spirit Club Hall,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.14,0:19:01.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.56,0:19:04.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuanli is this person here.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.24,0:19:07.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.36,0:19:17.74,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:22.48,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:27.18,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:33.38,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.38,0:19:39.53,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:44.33,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:49.01,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:55.53,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:20:06.85,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:12.27,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.27,0:20:17.31,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.31,0:20:28.54,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:34.09,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.09,0:20:40.93,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
